# Normalize line endings: store LF in the repo and check out LF on every
# platform. Without this, the Windows CI runner (git autocrlf=true) checks
# files out with CRLF, which prettier --check flags as unformatted (prettier's
# default endOfLine is lf) — making the format check fail on 100+ files.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary files must never be touched by line-ending normalization.
*.zip binary
*.exe binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.wasm binary
